## 3.5 分支限界法（Branch and Bound）
### 解决的问题
分支限界法类似回溯法，但使用广度优先搜索（队列）或最佳优先搜索（优先队列），通过界函数剪枝加速搜索。
### 与回溯法的区别
| 对比 | 回溯法 | 分支限界 |
|------|--------|----------|
| 搜索方式 | 深度优先 | 广度优先/最佳优先 |
| 目标 | 找一个解/所有解 | 找最优解 |
| 剪枝 | 条件判断 | 界函数 + 优先级 |
### 代码实现
```java
// 0-1背包 - 分支限界法（最佳优先）
public class KnapsackBB {
    public int knapsack(int[] weights, int[] values, int capacity) {
        PriorityQueue<Node> pq = new PriorityQueue<>(
            Comparator.comparingInt(n -> -n.upperBound));
        pq.offer(new Node(-1, 0, 0, bound(weights, values, capacity, 0, 0)));
        int maxProfit = 0;
        while (!pq.isEmpty()) {
            Node node = pq.poll();
            int i = node.level;
            if (i == weights.length - 1) {
                maxProfit = Math.max(maxProfit, node.profit);
                continue;
            }
            // 分支1：不选第i+1个物品
            Node left = new Node(i + 1, node.weight, node.profit,
                bound(weights, values, capacity, i + 1, node.profit));
            if (left.upperBound > maxProfit && left.weight <= capacity) {
                pq.offer(left);
            }
            // 分支2：选第i+1个物品
            if (node.weight + weights[i + 1] <= capacity) {
                Node right = new Node(i + 1, node.weight + weights[i + 1],
                    node.profit + values[i + 1],
                    bound(weights, values, capacity, i + 1, node.profit + values[i + 1]));
                if (right.upperBound > maxProfit) {
                    pq.offer(right);
                }
            }
        }
        return maxProfit;
    }

    private int bound(int[] w, int[] v, int capacity, int level, int profit) {
        int n = w.length;
        if (level >= n || w[level] > capacity) return profit;
        while (level < n && w[level] <= capacity - (level > 0 ? w[level - 1] : 0)) {
            capacity -= w[level];
            profit += v[level];
            level++;
        }
        if (level < n) profit += v[level] * (capacity / (float) w[level]);
        return profit;
    }

    static class Node {
        int level, weight, profit, upperBound;
        Node(int level, int weight, int profit, int upperBound) {
            this.level = level; this.weight = weight;
            this.profit = profit; this.upperBound = upperBound;
        }
    }
}
```
## 3.6 枚举与启发式算法
### 枚举法
```java
// 暴力枚举 - 子集和
public class SubsetSum {
    public List<List<Integer>> findSubsets(int[] nums, int target) {
        List<List<Integer>> result = new ArrayList<>();
        int n = nums.length;
        for (int mask = 0; mask < (1 << n); mask++) {
            List<Integer> subset = new ArrayList<>();
            int sum = 0;
            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
                if ((mask & (1 << i)) != 0) {
                    sum += nums[i];
                    subset.add(nums[i]);
                }
            }
            if (sum == target) result.add(subset);
        }
        return result;
    }
}
```
### 启发式算法
```java
// 模拟退火 - TSP问题（简化）
public class SimulatedAnnealing {
    private static final double INITIAL_TEMP = 10000;
    private static final double COOLING_RATE = 0.999;

    public int[] solve(int[] cities) {
        int[] current = cities.clone();
        double temp = INITIAL_TEMP;
        int[] best = current.clone();
        double bestCost = cost(current);

        while (temp > 1) {
            int[] next = generateNeighbor(current);
            double currentCost = cost(current);
            double nextCost = cost(next);
            double delta = nextCost - currentCost;

            if (delta < 0 || Math.random() < Math.exp(-delta / temp)) {
                current = next;
                if (nextCost < bestCost) {
                    best = next.clone();
                    bestCost = nextCost;
                }
            }
            temp *= COOLING_RATE;
        }
        return best;
    }

    private int[] generateNeighbor(int[] path) {
        int[] copy = path.clone();
        int i = (int) (Math.random() * path.length);
        int j = (int) (Math.random() * path.length);
        int temp = copy[i]; copy[i] = copy[j]; copy[j] = temp;
        return copy;
    }

    private double cost(int[] path) {
        double sum = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < path.length - 1; i++) {
            sum += distance(path[i], path[i + 1]);
        }
        return sum;
    }

    private double distance(int a, int b) { return Math.abs(a - b); }
}
```
## 3.7 本章小结
本章介绍了六种核心算法思维模式：
- **分治法**：分解→解决→合并，适合独立子问题
- **贪心算法**：局部最优→全局最优，需证明正确性
- **动态规划**：记录子问题解，适合重叠子问题
- **回溯算法**：尝试→回退→剪枝，适合枚举问题
- **分支限界**：广度优先+剪枝，适合找最优解
- **枚举与启发式**：暴力搜索或近似解
选择合适的算法思维模式是解决算法的第一步，需要根据问题特征决定。